WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.033
Step 1. Open the appointment.

1.2
00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:07.075
Rescheduling marks this appointment as Rescheduled and books a new one in the slot

1.3
00:00:07.075 --> 00:00:11.326
you choose. Select the appointment on the Appointments board.

2.1
00:00:11.326 --> 00:00:13.417
Step 2. Start the reschedule.

2.2
00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:18.242
Select the menu button with three dots, then Reschedule in the Actions menu.

2.3
00:00:18.242 --> 00:00:26.950
Enter a note for the current appointment, read the warning, and select Continue.

3.1
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:32.107
Step 3. Set the tags and the note. A sheet opens to choose the new slot.

3.2
00:00:32.107 --> 00:00:37.287
Tag changes save on the current appointment at once; the Note is for the new

3.3
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:38.605
appointment.

4.1
00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:42.796
Step 4. Choose the new slot. Select a day in the calendar.

4.2
00:00:42.796 --> 00:00:47.213
If the day has more than one schedule, choose the schedule first.

4.3
00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:51.586
Then choose a slot; Care selects the first one available.

5.1
00:00:51.586 --> 00:00:55.579
Step 5. Reschedule the appointment. Select Reschedule.

5.2
00:00:55.579 --> 00:01:01.900
Care opens the new appointment on Appointment Details, Booked in the slot you chose.
